        <details>data/Movies/190830 contains unaligned movies related to collection "LMB Krios2-1". The "_hn_"-portion of the filename, where n=1-9, denotes the hole position within the 3x3 image-shift acquisition matrix. Two exposures per hole are differentiated by the time-stamp portion of the filename (~20 seconds apart). Micrographs were collected with a nominal stage-tilt of 30deg. The files were written as gain-unnormalised integer TIFF files by serialEM. The real pixel size is 1.1 Å/pix. The dose rate is 1.02 e/Å^2/frame. Please use data/Movies/GainRef/190830_gainref.mrc as gain reference without any rotation or flipping. The associated K2 defects file is data/Movies/Defect/190830_defects.txt.</details>
